    "poca": "For each closest segment pair, every outgoing incident tangent d at each witness obeys d dot (other-self)<=0. At an interior use +/- tangent; at a vertex use both incident directions; at an open tip only the existing direction. Exclude identical material point/adjacent edges; MinRad handles the local turn.",
    "minrad_rows": "Gprev=|a|^2-r^2|kb|^2>=0, Gnext=|b|^2-r^2|kb|^2>=0. Grad=-2r^2 Jkb^T kb plus the derivative of the corresponding edge squared length. No min-length branch or normalized-kb singularity at straight.",
    "static_numerics": "Float closest-segment and tangent-sign tests with stated numerical tolerance. These controls do not supply exact predicates.",
    "dynamic_limit": "Do not freeze a current POCA mask during CCD: a previously noncritical pair can become critical. Need a time-valid exclusion/criticality test or certified step subdivision with local curvature included. Endpoint checks alone do not prove trajectory safety.",
    "contact_rows": "Unilateral lambda>=0 with complementarity, not an unconditional hard equality. As checks, reject/rollback violating trials. As coupled rows, update active set and bandwidth/rank logic; old cord half-band10 no longer applies.",
    "source": "https://jasoncantarella.com/downloads/octrope/octrope_paper.pdf Definition1 and Lemma2.1; formulas implemented independently, no GPL library vendored."
